  "properties": {
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Art Share: Top Artists</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script src=\"script.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <main>\n    <h1>Find Top Artists</h1>\n    \n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <label for=\"thresholdInput\">Minimum Likes:</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"thresholdInput\" value=\"500\" placeholder=\"e.g. 1000\">\n      <button id=\"filterBtn\">Show Top Artists</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <ul id=\"artistList\"></ul>\n  </main>\n\n</body>\n</html>  ",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  font-family: sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f4f4f9;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\nmain {\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  background: white;\n  padding: 20px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #333;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 10px;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  padding-bottom: 20px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;\n}\n\ninput {\n  padding: 8px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  width: 100px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  background-color: #2c3e50;\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background-color: #4ca1af;\n}\n\nul {\n  list-style-type: none;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nli {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  padding: 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.likes-tag {\n  background-color: #eee;\n  padding: 4px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-size: 0.9em;\n  color: #555;\n}\n\n/* Update li to handle more content */\nli {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-start; /* Aligns to top if text wraps */\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  padding: 15px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n  font-size: 1.1em;\n}\n\n.details {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 0.9em;\n  color: #666;\n}\n\n.meta {\n  font-size: 0.8em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin-top: 5px;\n}\n\n/* Visual cue for the \"Corporate\" bias */\n.major-label {\n  color: #2c3e50; /* Dark Blue */\n}\n\n.indie-label {\n  color: #e67e22; /* Orange */\n}\n\n.stats {\n  text-align: right;\n  min-width: 100px;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// 1. DOM Elements\nconst artistList = document.querySelector(\"#artistList\");\nconst filterBtn = document.querySelector(\"#filterBtn\");\nconst thresholdInput = document.querySelector(\"#thresholdInput\");\n\n// 2. Data: Array of objects representing the dataset\nconst artists = [\n  { \n    name: \"The Icons\", \n    likes: 2500000, \n    genre: \"Pop\", \n    age: 45, \n    albums: 12, \n    label: \"Global Corp\",\n    location: \"Los Angeles\" \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Golden Era\", \n    likes: 1800000, \n    genre: \"Rock\", \n    age: 52, \n    albums: 15, \n    label: \"Global Corp\",\n    location: \"London\" \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Star Power\", \n    likes: 3100000, \n    genre: \"Pop\", \n    age: 38, \n    albums: 9, \n    label: \"Global Corp\",\n    location: \"New York\" \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Neon Soul\", \n    likes: 850, \n    genre: \"R&B\", \n    age: 22, \n    albums: 1, \n    label: \"Indie\",\n    location: \"Atlanta\" \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Folk Tales\", \n    likes: 420, \n    genre: \"Acoustic\", \n    age: 26, \n    albums: 2, \n    label: \"Self-Released\",\n    location: \"Austin\" \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Glitch Mode\", \n    likes: 150, \n    genre: \"Electronic\", \n    age: 19, \n    albums: 0, \n    label: \"SoundCloud\",\n    location: \"Berlin\" \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Velvet Voice\", \n    likes: 1200000, \n    genre: \"Soul/Pop\", \n    age: 41, \n    albums: 8, \n    label: \"Global Corp\",\n    location: \"Chicago\" \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Underground King\", \n    likes: 900, \n    genre: \"Hip Hop\", \n    age: 21, \n    albums: 1, \n    label: \"Indie\",\n    location: \"Detroit\" \n  }\n];\n\n// 3. Event Listeners\nfilterBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  // Capture the threshold number from the input\n  let threshold = Number(thresholdInput.value);\n  \n  // Get the filtered list based on that number\n  let topArtists = filterByLikes(threshold);\n  \n  // Update the screen\n  renderArtists(topArtists);\n});\n\n// 4. Functions\n\n// Returns a new array containing only artists with likes >= threshold\nfunction filterByLikes(limit) {\n  let filtered = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < artists.length; i++) {\n    // Check if the current artist's likes meet the requirement\n    if (artists[i].likes >= limit) {\n      filtered.push(artists[i]);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return filtered;\n}\n\n// Helper to display the list \nfunction renderArtists(list) {\n  artistList.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {\n    const artist = list[i];\n    const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n\n    // We add a class based on label to visually distinguish them\n    const isMajor = artist.label === \"Global Corp\" ? \"major-label\" : \"indie-label\";\n\n    li.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"artist-info\">\n        <h3>${artist.name}</h3>\n        <p class=\"details\">\n           ${artist.age}yo | ${artist.genre} | ${artist.albums} Albums\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"meta ${isMajor}\">${artist.label}</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stats\">\n        <span class=\"likes-tag\">Likes: ${artist.likes.toLocaleString()}</span>\n      </div>\n    `;\n\n    artistList.appendChild(li);\n  }\n}\n\n// Initial Render (Show all artists to start)\nrenderArtists(artists);",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This\r\n\r\nImagine you're curating the homepage of a music streaming platform. The algorithm only shows \"top artists,\" but it seems to be the same few people every week. Why do some creators stay hidden?\r\n\r\n**Record your answers in your activity guide:**\r\n* Enter **100** in the input and click \"Show Top Artists\". What do you notice? \r\n* Enter **1,000,000**. What do you notice now?\r\n* **Reflect:** What do the remaining \"Top Artists\" have in common? (Look at their different properties).",
